cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ABDA-NL, please cite the accompanying COMMA 2026 demonstration
  paper.
title: ABDA-NL
abstract: >-
  A browser-based natural-language scenario explorer for argument-based
  reasoning. ABDA-NL lets users inspect, explain, and extend ASPIC- scenarios
  while the deterministic ABDA engine remains authoritative for argumentation
  semantics.
type: software
authors:
